    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Spacewar! is a computer game conceived in 1961 by Martin Graetz, Stephen Russell, and Wayne Wiitanen. It was first realized on the PDP-1 in 1962 by Stephen Russell, Peter Samson, Dan Edwards, and Martin Graetz, together with Alan Kotok, Steve Piner, and Robert A Saunders. Spacewar! is in the public domain.\r\n                    \r\nThis package contains: the original version of the game, recreated from a printed version of the source provided by Graetz; a PDP-1 Emulation Suite to run the game; and more technical documentation and user instructions.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
